WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.400
Your customers need answers at 2 PM and at 2 AM.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.750
Most support teams can't keep up: long queues, repeat contacts and after-hours gaps.

3
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:10.400
Gartner predicts agentic AI will resolve 80 percent of common customer service issues by 2029, yet 95 percent of service leaders plan to keep human agents.

4
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.750
The answer is people and AI, together.

5
00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.900
AI handles the routine. People handle the moments that matter.

6
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.750
Every request goes to the level that resolves it best: AI self-service, agents with AI assist, or technical specialists.

7
00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:27.750
TEAM International runs customer care and technical support across every channel and tier, including IT help desk, 24/7/365.

8
00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:33.250
We manage contact center operations: workforce management, quality assurance and SLAs, on a live service dashboard.

9
00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:38.250
CX analytics show why customers contact you, so recurring issues get fixed at the source.

10
00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:43.750
Intelligent automation resolves routine requests instantly, and agent assist gives every agent a case summary and the next best answer.

11
00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:49.750
And a clear path from operating support to optimizing, understanding, automating and transforming your customer experience.

12
00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:56.750
We're measured on outcomes, not seats: CSAT, first contact resolution, SLA attainment and cost-to-serve.

13
00:00:57.150 --> 00:01:02.750
Multilingual teams in your time zone: Medellín serves North America and Ukraine serves Europe, from ISO 27001-certified locations.

14
00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:06.900
Start with a Customer Care Assessment, and get baseline KPIs, a service design with SLAs and a transition plan.

15
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.750
TEAM International.
